-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SDK library itself (Simou3CameraSDK) has no third-party runtime
dependencies.

The example program (Sample) optionally uses OpenCV
(https://opencv.org/) for image display. OpenCV is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (OpenCV 4.5.0 and later). OpenCV is NOT bundled
with this SDK; it must be provided by the build environment. If OpenCV is
not found, the sample is skipped and the SDK library still builds.
